<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context":"https:\/\/schema.org","@type":"NewsArticle","headline":"YEN\u0130 Parti Manisa'da \u00f6n se\u00e7im heyecan\u0131: Cezaevindeki \u0130lksen \u00d6zalper tek aday","articleSection":"Manisa","dateCreated":"2026-10-17T12:29:00+03:00","datePublished":"2026-10-17T12:29:00+03:00","dateModified":"2026-10-17T12:29:00+03:00","wordCount":259,"genre":"news","mainEntityOfPage":{"@type":"WebPage","@id":"https:\/\/www.manisahaberleri.com\/yeni-parti-manisada-on-secim-heyecani-cezaevindeki-ilksen-ozalper-tek-aday"},"articleBody":"\u200bDaha \u00f6nce y\u00fcr\u00fct\u00fclen bir soru\u015fturma kapsam\u0131nda tutuklanarak cezaevine g\u00f6nderilen \u0130lksen \u00d6zalper, \u00f6n se\u00e7ime tek aday olarak kat\u0131l\u0131yor. \u00d6zalper'in tek aday olmas\u0131 nedeniyle, yap\u0131lacak \u00f6n se\u00e7imin ard\u0131ndan \u00f6n\u00fcm\u00fczdeki hafta d\u00fczenlenecek il kongresinde Yeni Parti Manisa \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 g\u00f6revini \u00fcstlenmesi kesinle\u015fmi\u015f durumda.\r\n\r\n\u200bSand\u0131klar Pazar G\u00fcn\u00fc Kuruluyor: \u0130\u015fte Oy Kullan\u0131lacak Merkezler\r\n\r\n\u200bParti \u00fcyelerinin kat\u0131l\u0131m\u0131yla ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilecek olan \u00f6n se\u00e7im organizasyonuna dair ayr\u0131nt\u0131lar da belli oldu. \u015eehzadeler ve Yunusemre il\u00e7e ba\u015fkanl\u0131klar\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan payla\u015f\u0131lan bro\u015f\u00fcrlerle duyuruldu:\r\n\r\n\u200b\u015eehzadeler \u0130l\u00e7esi\r\n\u200b\u015eehzadeler \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkan\u0131 Mert \u00d6zk\u00f6semen taraf\u0131ndan yap\u0131lan duyuruya g\u00f6re oy verme i\u015flemi 6 ayr\u0131 merkezde ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilecek:\r\nK\u00fclt\u00fcr Sitesi, Nurlup\u0131nar, Yenik\u00f6y, Karaa\u011fa\u00e7l\u0131, A\u015fa\u011f\u0131\u00e7obanisa, Sancakl\u0131i\u011fdecik.\r\n\r\n\u200bYunusemre \u0130l\u00e7esi\r\n\u200bYunusemre \u0130l\u00e7e Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan organize edilen oy verme merkezleri ise \u015fu \u015fekilde belirlendi:\r\n\r\nFerdi Zeyrek Millet \u00c7ar\u015f\u0131s\u0131\r\nYEN\u0130 Parti Muradiye B\u00fcrosu (Muradiye Mh. Ata Sk. NO: 16A)\r\n\r\n\u200bT\u00fcm \u00fcyelerin sand\u0131k ba\u015f\u0131na davet edildi\u011fi \u00f6n se\u00e7im maratonunun ard\u0131ndan, g\u00f6zler \u00f6n\u00fcm\u00fczdeki hafta yap\u0131lacak olan resmi il kongresine \u00e7evrilecek.\r\n\r\n\u00d6zg\u00fcr \u00d6zel de kat\u0131labilir\r\n\u00d6te yandan \u00f6n\u00fcm\u00fczdeki hafta yap\u0131lacak olan ilk kongresine Genel Ba\u015fkan \u00d6zg\u00fcr \u00d6zel'in de kat\u0131laca\u011f\u0131 \u00f6\u011frenildi. \u00d6zel'in planlamada bir de\u011fi\u015fiklik olmamas\u0131 durumunda kongreye kat\u0131lmas\u0131na kesin g\u00f6z\u00fcyle bak\u0131l\u0131yor.\r\n\r\n","description":"Yeni Parti Manisa \u0130l Ba\u015fkanl\u0131\u011f\u0131 se\u00e7imleri \u00f6ncesinde kritik viraja girildi. \u00d6n\u00fcm\u00fczdeki hafta ger\u00e7ekle\u015ftirilecek olan ola\u011fan il kongresi \u00f6ncesinde, partide 18 Ekim 2026 Pazar g\u00fcn\u00fc \u00fcyelerin kat\u0131l\u0131m\u0131yla \u00f6n se\u00e7im yap\u0131lacak. \u00d6zelper'in kesin se\u00e7ilmesi bekleniyor.","inLanguage":"tr-TR","keywords":["yeni parti"],"image":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/manisahaberlericom.teimg.com\/crop\/1280x720\/manisahaberleri-com\/uploads\/2026\/10\/bbbbb-40.png","width":"1280","height":"720","caption":"YEN\u0130 Parti Manisa'da \u00f6n se\u00e7im heyecan\u0131: Cezaevindeki \u0130lksen \u00d6zalper tek aday"},"publishingPrinciples":"https:\/\/www.manisahaberleri.com\/gizlilik-sozlesmesi","isFamilyFriendly":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","isAccessibleForFree":"http:\/\/schema.org\/True","publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Manisa Haberleri","image":"https:\/\/manisahaberlericom.teimg.com\/manisahaberleri-com\/uploads\/2023\/03\/manisahaberleri.png","logo":{"@type":"ImageObject","url":"https:\/\/manisahaberlericom.teimg.com\/manisahaberleri-com\/uploads\/2023\/03\/manisahaberleri.png","width":"640","height":"375"}},"author":{"@type":"Person","name":"\u0130clal \u00c7i\u00e7ek","jobTitle":"","url":"https:\/\/www.manisahaberleri.com\/muhabir\/39\/iclal-cicek"},"creator":{"@type":"Organization","name":"Manisa Haberleri","url":"https:\/\/www.manisahaberleri.com"},"license":"https:\/\/www.manisahaberleri.com\/gizlilik-sozlesmesi"}</script>


